#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:8
#: 2a33520c58204f73b5108cd025a14e87
msgid "ArduPilot Partners Program"
msgstr "ArduPilot 合作伙伴计划"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:10
#: bd73077634e544ae8217b13912cfa287
msgid ""
"The ArduPilot Project is the result of an immense amount of effort from "
"software and hardware engineers, beta testers, web developers, documenters, "
"researchers and many others.  A vast number of individuals, institutions and"
" companies use and contribute to ArduPilot - in the spirit of Free and Open "
"Source Software we freely and openly welcome their involvement in the "
"project.  There is no cost to use, or contribute to, any software provided "
"by ArduPilot. The Project does incur costs though, so this page explains our"
" Partners Program for :ref:`corporate sponsors <common-partners>`."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 项目是软件和硬件工程师、测试人员、网络开发人员、文档编写者、研究人员及许多其他人大量努力的成果。大量个人、机构和公司使用并贡献于 "
"ArduPilot——本着自由开源软件的精神，我们自由、开放地欢迎他们参与该项目。使用或贡献 ArduPilot "
"提供的任何软件均无需付费。但项目确实会产生费用，因此本页介绍了我们针对 :ref:`企业赞助商 <common-partners>` 的合作伙伴计划。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:14
#: 17b87259d9b340b3adacb93a9c7e6709
msgid "Why a Partners Program"
msgstr "为什么要建立合作伙伴计划"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:15
#: 7454266041f04be08133c2056e7db624
msgid "ArduPilot is a free and open-source software project that includes:"
msgstr "ArduPilot 是一个免费开源软件项目，包含："

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:17
#: 6dcc115bcd584e5ca064b17401d1b725
msgid ""
"Embedded firmware that is designed to serve as the control system for "
"autonomous vehicles, and supports many different hardware targets listed on "
"the Supported Hardware page"
msgstr "嵌入式固件，旨在作为自主飞行器的控制系统，并支持支持硬件页面上列出的许多不同硬件目标"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:18
#: b4463dfc03fb4b38a01c570a2e09516f
msgid ""
"A number of Ground Control Station software applications that allow "
"management of vehicles running ArduPilot firmware, e.g. more convenient "
"settings editing on an often more comfortable interface, firmware download "
"and transfer, upgrading and conversion of settings between different devices"
" and versions, fleet management, operations monitoring and more"
msgstr ""
"多款地面控制站软件应用程序，允许管理运行 ArduPilot "
"固件的飞行器，例如在更舒适的界面上便捷编辑设置、固件下载和传输、在不同设备和版本间升级和转换设置、机队管理、运营监控等"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:19
#: f495cbd534f642ae95afdba16e0c7558
msgid ""
"The https://ardupilot.org website, https://discuss.ardupilot.org forum and "
"this wiki"
msgstr "https://ardupilot.org 网站、https://discuss.ardupilot.org 论坛和本 Wiki"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:20
#: fd70374c42ba423abbc919339753e90b
msgid ""
"Server infrastructure dedicated to distributing software and firmware, and "
"testing/building/distributing of the different variants for all the "
"different supported platforms and options"
msgstr "专用于分发软件和固件的服务器基础设施，以及针对所有不同受支持平台和选项的不同变体的测试/构建/分发"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:21
#: 563072df8cae46ad88882debdd0274b7
msgid ""
"A global community of users with an enormous variety of goals and "
"expectations"
msgstr "拥有各种目标和期望的全球用户社区"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:22
#: 5ac67ce2d09845099a9b2ae11cc753d5
msgid ""
"A global team of developers with deep technical knowledge of the project’s "
"code and of its management"
msgstr "对项目代码和管理有深厚技术知识的全球开发团队"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:24
#: 669b2e63b66d424895817ce5805d8b7b
msgid ""
"In order to continue providing, maintaining and improving the rich ArduPilot"
" ecosystem, the Project relies heavily on generous donations of time from "
"many people - but we also incur financial costs that must be covered.  "
"Simplistically, meeting these costs is what the Partners Program achieves."
msgstr ""
"为了继续提供、维护和改进丰富的 ArduPilot "
"生态系统，项目在很大程度上依赖于许多人慷慨捐献的时间——但我们也会产生必须覆盖的财务成本。简单来说，合作伙伴计划的目标就是满足这些成本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:30
#: 05d7083e3c9d4d98b792582693313062
msgid ""
"The partnerships we have with companies also help to guide the development "
"of ArduPilot. We look to the partners to help us choose what features to "
"prioritise, what documentation we need to work on and how we can best use "
"the funds we have available to continue to make ArduPilot the best autopilot"
" available."
msgstr ""
"我们与公司建立的合作伙伴关系也有助于指导 ArduPilot "
"的开发。我们希望合作伙伴帮助我们确定优先开发哪些功能、需要完善哪些文档，以及如何最好地利用可用资金继续使 ArduPilot 成为最佳飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:37
#: 8529b6e835064fbeba8bf03dc901d8be
msgid "Partner Support"
msgstr "合作伙伴支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:39
#: cf9f97b496f943de8c335c37c7bb4d65
msgid ""
"One of the biggest benefits to a company of joining the partners program is "
"the deep level of technical support that we can provide. For each partner we"
" create a private discussion channel where the partner can ask questions, "
"post logs for review or discuss features. We also have a shared channel that"
" all partners can access to facilitate discussions between partners."
msgstr ""
"公司加入合作伙伴计划的最大好处之一是我们可以提供深层次的技术支持。对于每个合作伙伴，我们会创建一个私密讨论频道，合作伙伴可以在那里提问、发布日志供审查或讨论功能。我们还有一个所有合作伙伴都可以访问的共享频道，以促进合作伙伴之间的讨论。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:46
#: 01519d0fe86f43d79f314918e4197960
msgid ""
"The partners program funds highly qualified support engineers to help "
"support the needs of partners. These support engineers are not full time, "
"but we do strive to provide very timely support for partners and we're proud"
" of our track record of providing top quality support and technical advice."
msgstr ""
"合作伙伴计划资助高度专业的支持工程师来帮助满足合作伙伴的支持需求。这些支持工程师不是全职的，但我们确实力求为合作伙伴提供非常及时的支持，并为我们提供顶级支持和技术建议的良好记录感到自豪。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:52
#: 63a83998e6394a1991c5e1f6a9f9c6b5
msgid ""
"For more complex development tasks we may refer the partner to a dev team "
"member who can provide more extensive paid consulting in a specialist area."
msgstr "对于更复杂的开发任务，我们可能会将合作伙伴推荐给能够在专业领域提供更广泛付费咨询的开发团队成员。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:57
#: e2cd7f02c74540f78a6334a88b6a6898
msgid "Monthly Partners Call"
msgstr "月度合作伙伴电话会议"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:59
#: 0e1c42bfad1844bf95582f678af83c6a
msgid ""
"In addition to the private partner support channel, we also hold a monthly "
"meeting that all partners are invited to where the core development team "
"presents an update on the development of ArduPilot and discusses priorities "
"with partners. We use this meeting to hold in-depth technical discussions "
"with partners on any topic of interest, plus it gives an opportunity for "
"partners to announce new products."
msgstr ""
"除了私密合作伙伴支持频道外，我们还每月举行一次邀请所有合作伙伴参加的会议，核心开发团队在会议上介绍 ArduPilot "
"的开发进展并与合作伙伴讨论优先事项。我们利用这次会议与合作伙伴就任何感兴趣的话题进行深入技术讨论，同时也为合作伙伴提供宣布新产品的机会。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:67
#: 6d6abec1f96149e6b672bc7eca0da8c7
msgid "How does my company become a partner?"
msgstr "我的公司如何成为合作伙伴？"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:69
#: 90e33671fc664db8be8e1c7af5c703d0
msgid ""
"The first step in becoming a partner is to email the partners program "
"coordinator at `partners@ardupilot.org <mailto:partners@ardupilot.org>`__ to"
" start the application process."
msgstr ""
"成为合作伙伴的第一步是发送电子邮件至合作伙伴计划协调员 `partners@ardupilot.org "
"<mailto:partners@ardupilot.org>`__ 开始申请流程。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:73
#: b1dd4b1fae5c4963b44bd9d43dfc25c3
msgid ""
"You will receive a reply within a couple of days. After that the steps are:"
msgstr "您将在几天内收到回复。之后的步骤如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:76
#: 876505d4a87545e488b05f58a312f011
msgid ""
"you will receive a link to a form to fill in giving details of your "
"application"
msgstr "您将收到一个表格链接，填写您的申请详情"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:77
#: fee510d5702749fab49d243e40d06fa4
msgid ""
"you will need to agree to abide by the `ArduPilot Code of Conduct "
"<https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"您需要同意遵守 `ArduPilot 行为准则 <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/developer-code-of-"
"conduct.html>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:78
#: 1488807fb8d44fc88063de7cb168fbb3
msgid ""
"companies interested in joining the program must demonstrate compliance with"
" the `ArduPilot Code of Conduct <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/developer-"
"code-of-conduct.html>`__, either by providing a link to their official "
"website or through other verifiable means."
msgstr ""
"有意加入计划的公司必须通过提供其官方网站链接或其他可验证方式证明符合 `ArduPilot 行为准则 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.html>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:79
#: 5ed219365b14438e95780fac9294efe5
msgid ""
"you will need to make a payment of a minimum of US$1500. For larger "
"companies we strongly encourage larger contributions, with typical amounts "
"of $5000 to $10000 for companies that rely on ArduPilot for their business. "
"Details of payment methods are given below"
msgstr ""
"您需要支付最低 US$1500 的费用。对于较大的公司，我们强烈鼓励更多贡献，依赖 ArduPilot 开展业务的公司的典型金额为 $5000 至 "
"$10000。付款方式详情见下文"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:80
#: 5a46094c31494c2f9d8e7f24e4591e0c
msgid ""
"you will need to send a logo to put on our website, unless you specifically "
"ask not to be included in the public list of partners"
msgstr "您需要发送一个标志放到我们的网站上，除非您特别要求不列入公开合作伙伴名单"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:81
#: 251b9c4ac8c8438e917c57c81df82e2b
msgid ""
"once payment is received we will create the private support channel for your"
" company (on `discord <https://ardupilot.org/discord>`__ or skype) and add "
"you to the partners list"
msgstr ""
"收到付款后，我们将为您的公司创建私密支持频道（在 `discord <https://ardupilot.org/discord>`__ 或 Skype"
" 上）并将您添加到合作伙伴列表"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:82
#: aa4e600e3a834c48a1104b96f2b629e9
msgid ""
"the partners coordinator will setup a time to have an onboarding call to get"
" to know you and to learn how we can best support your use of ArduPilot"
msgstr "合作伙伴协调员将安排一次入职电话会议，以了解您并了解我们如何最好地支持您对 ArduPilot 的使用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:83
#: 8c6926d841e04d1288c8a8cb0aa84538
msgid ""
"you can then add the `ArduPilot Partner logo "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/Logos/Partners/logos.html>`__ on your "
"website to show your support for the ArduPilot project"
msgstr ""
"然后您可以在您的网站上添加 `ArduPilot 合作伙伴标志 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/Logos/Partners/logos.html>`__，以展示您对 "
"ArduPilot 项目的支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:84
#: 73356756d72c452d87c70786f2242748
msgid ""
"you will be added to the partners mailing list and partners discord channel"
msgstr "您将被添加到合作伙伴邮件列表和合作伙伴 discord 频道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:85
#: af512d1282954fba9a29e8f0bde3c2e5
msgid ""
"you will receive an invitation to the monthly partners development call"
msgstr "您将收到月度合作伙伴开发电话会议的邀请"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:87
#: 0e58ddf7a356411ab78ab07781609a2c
msgid ""
"If you have not received a reply from the Partners Program Coordinator in 2 "
"business days, please check the SPAM folder of your inbox. Otherwise, fill "
"out `this form <https://forms.gle/pZN81bcjiVez7QpN9>`__ and the Coordinator "
"will reach out to you shortly."
msgstr ""
"如果您在 2 个工作日内没有收到合作伙伴计划协调员的回复，请检查您收件箱的垃圾邮件文件夹。否则，请填写 `此表格 "
"<https://forms.gle/pZN81bcjiVez7QpN9>`__，协调员将很快与您联系。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:90
#: 379ddae01f5d43a4805fa936917b9cb0
msgid "Payment Methods"
msgstr "付款方式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:92
#: c635b201277a4ac7bd3a54bb0f8ec8b3
msgid ""
"After you have filled in the partner application form the partners "
"coordinator will ask you to make your payment. We can accept payments in a "
"number of ways."
msgstr "填写合作伙伴申请表后，合作伙伴协调员将要求您付款。我们可以接受多种付款方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:96
#: 398f9b06faa94c1a85cd8eef4e042398
msgid ""
"the simplest and preferred method is via `paypal to the ArduPilot Foundation"
" <https://ardupilot.org/donate>`__"
msgstr ""
"最简单且首选的方式是通过 `Paypal 向 ArduPilot 基金会 <https://ardupilot.org/donate>`__ 付款"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:97
#: 6d41105b146b48f5935b76aa4c35c73b
msgid ""
"you can do a bank transfer directly to the ArduPilot Foundation Australian "
"bank account. The partners coordinator can give you the bank account details"
" on request"
msgstr "您可以直接向 ArduPilot 基金会的澳大利亚银行账户进行银行转账。合作伙伴协调员可根据要求提供银行账户详情"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:98
#: fd7126c0175647ab81bac64e24641edd
msgid ""
"if neither of the first two options are suitable, you can donate via the SPI"
" click and pledge system at `Click&Pledge "
"<https://co.clickandpledge.com/advanced/default.aspx?wid=34115>`__"
msgstr ""
"如果前两种方式都不适合，您可以通过 SPI 的 Click and Pledge 系统在 `Click&Pledge "
"<https://co.clickandpledge.com/advanced/default.aspx?wid=34115>`__ 进行捐款"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:99
#: 62a0d51fb3ad4da18d31cd6a64fc1902
msgid ""
"finally we can give you bank details for donating directly to our SPI US "
"bank account"
msgstr "最后，我们可以提供直接向我们 SPI 美国银行账户捐款的银行详情"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:102
#: 7689d2e4543a4ee0937be651244a5605
msgid "How are collected funds spent?"
msgstr "募集的资金如何使用？"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:103
#: 62c6770a85214942a57cdde373c52cb0
msgid ""
"Funds are first used to cover fixed costs including servers to host the "
"wiki, forum, autotest and build servers and other running expenses. We also "
"fund 3 part time highly qualified support engineers to help partners with "
"support, a Wiki documentation maintainer, and the partners coordinator "
"position to ensure the partners program runs smoothly."
msgstr ""
"资金首先用于覆盖固定成本，包括托管 Wiki、论坛、自动测试和构建服务器的服务器费用及其他运营费用。我们还资助 3 "
"名兼职高度专业的支持工程师帮助合作伙伴支持、一名 Wiki 文档维护员和合作伙伴协调员职位，以确保合作伙伴计划顺利运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:105
#: 6640e1e0319b4f679aa81b293d530143
msgid ""
"A Funding Committee of 3 members is voted on annually from within the "
"Development Team to oversee and control financial matters."
msgstr "一个由 3 名成员组成的资金委员会每年从开发团队内部投票选出，以监督和控制财务事务。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:108
#: 77c68d71fbf94f7e9388d16cb8f69367
msgid "I'm not a company, but I love your work, how can I help?"
msgstr "我不是公司，但我喜欢你们的工作，我能如何帮助？"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:109
#: e28ef7760bde44a4a57fa9c0fb30c301
msgid ""
"Please see our more general, :ref:`how-to-donate <common-donation>` page but"
" in short, we accept donations of any amount from individuals as well.  Also"
" please consider helping out with documentation, beta testing or code "
"development.  Tell your friends and post videos of your successes with "
"ArduPilot!"
msgstr ""
"请参阅我们更通用的 :ref:`how-to-donate <common-donation>` "
"页面，简而言之，我们也接受个人任意金额的捐款。另外，请考虑帮助文档、测试或代码开发。告诉您的朋友并发布您使用 ArduPilot 成功的视频！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:112
#: 2e061999036c4b11a4f66e4fc6d719fb
msgid "I want a new feature, do I have to be a partner to get it?"
msgstr "我想要一个新功能，必须成为合作伙伴才能获得吗？"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:113
#: 34ca0857cd8447019211fca4d42ae07d
msgid ""
"No.  ArduPilot is, and always will be, open source.  Contributions to the "
"code base, wherever they come from, are accepted based on their technical "
"merits.  If you're not in a position to make the changes yourself, please "
"add it to the `Issues list "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues>`__ or consider contracting "
"one of the companies listed on the :ref:`Commercial Support page <common-"
"commercial-support>` to make the change."
msgstr ""
"不需要。ArduPilot 是，也将永远是开源的。对代码库的贡献，无论来自哪里，都根据其技术优点被接受。如果您自己无法进行更改，请将其添加到 `问题列表"
" <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues>`__，或考虑委托 :ref:`商业支持页面 "
"<common-commercial-support>` 上列出的公司之一进行更改。"
